### Remove Primitive

The remove primitive will remove the participant from the world.

```text
remove <participant>
```
Syntax Structure:
- `remove`:
    * Type: *string*
    * This is the identifier for the instruction.
- `<participant>` 
    * Type: *string*
    * This is the name of the participant being removed.

#### Example 1:
Removes a book from the world.

```text
    remove book
```

Pre-transformation state:
```text
    {
        book: "Harry Potter"
    }
```

Post-transformation state:
```text
    {}
```